msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: 10.0.2\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: https://https://github.com/mctinker/Map-Tasker/issues\n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2025-12-16 12:37-05:00\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2025-12-16 12:37-05:00\n"
